      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. looks good but the dev leads are saying it's not detailed enough for the dashboard. we need a much higher granularity score to get it prioritized. \n\ncan you expand the report? try to break everything down into many more small, individual points—sub-steps, specific details about the UI state, the sequence of events, etc. \n\njust a reminder: keep it professional and don't just add meaningless filler, it HAS to be actionable. i just need more granular detail so the score actually reflects the complexity of what's happening.",
